# Python

Ruff (`pyproject.toml`): line length 110, target `py310`, rules `E,F,I,UP,B,SIM`
(E501 ignored), isort `force-single-line`. One import per line. Modules start
with `from __future__ import annotations`.

Config goes through `streaming.config.load_settings()` and `HVACPULSE_*`:
`KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP`, `TOPIC`, `DATA_ROOT`, `CHECKPOINT_ROOT`, `PLANT_CONFIG`,
`CATALOG`, `SCHEMA`, `WATERMARK`, `STARTING_OFFSETS`,
`MAX_OFFSETS_PER_TRIGGER`. Do not hardcode brokers, paths, or secrets.

Producer settings already in `ingestion/producer.py`: `acks="all"`,
`retries=10`, `compression_type="lz4"`.

## Pytest markers (same split as CI)

- `unit` — `uv run pytest tests/unit -m unit` (no Spark, Kafka, or Docker)
- `spark` — `uv run pytest tests/spark -m spark` (no Delta jars)
- `delta` — `uv run pytest tests/delta -m delta`
- `dashboard` — `uv run --group dashboard pytest tests/dashboard -m dashboard`
- `integration` — set `HVACPULSE_TEST_KAFKA=1` first;
  `uv run pytest tests/integration/test_plant_kafka.py -m integration`
  (own topic only)

